  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Garukirikawa Coffee Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Coffee production and processing).Beneficiaries: 237 members (including 45 women).Description: The funds will be used to increase the quantity and quality of members&apos; coffee production; specifically, funds will be used to construct a storage facility with an office and solar power system; complete the construction of an environmentally sound washing station with water catchment system; construct four collection centers; procure a motorcycle; establish a purchase fund for crop transportation; provide training in agricultural techniques; and improve the cooperative&apos;s technical, financial and administrative management capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
